utions. The resolutions propose ratification of the EAAA India Employee Stock Option Scheme 2024 and approval for granting employee stock options to group company employees under this scheme. The notice states no new scheme is introduced and no increase in options is proposed. The remote e-voting facility commences on Friday, November 13, 2026, at 9:00 a.m. IST and concludes on Saturday, December 12, 2026, at 5:00 p.m. IST. The cut-off date for voting eligibility is Friday, November 6, 2026. Ms. Ashita Kaul has been appointed as the scrutinizer. The results of the postal ballot, along with the scrutinizer's report, are scheduled to be declared on or before Tuesday, December 15, 2026.", "voiceUrl": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.in/ann_voice/EAAA_12112026181231_Intimation.mp3"}, {"an_dt": "11-Nov-2026 18:15:12", "attFileSize": "229.15 KB", "attchmntFile": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.in/corporate/EAAA_11112026181240_Intimation.pdf", "attchmntText": "EAAA India Alternatives Limited has informed the Exchange about Link of Recording", "bflag": null, "csvName": null, "desc": "Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates", "difference": "00:00:01", "dt": "11112026181512", "exchdisstime": "11-Nov-2026 18:15:13", "fileSize": "229.15 KB", "hasXbrl": true, "old_new": null, "orgid": null, "seq_id": "106855509", "smIndustry": null, "sm_isin": "INE528L01027", "sm_name": "EAAA India Alternatives Limited", "sort_date": "2026-11-11 18:15:12", "symbol": "EDELALTS", "voiceSummary": null, "voiceUrl": null}, {"an_dt": "11-Nov-2026 14:16:40", "attFileSize": "2.42 MB", "attchmntFile": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.in/corporate/EAAA_11112026141620_EarningsUpdate.pdf", "attchmntText": "EAAA India Alternatives Limited has informed the Exchange about Investor Presentation", "bflag": null, "csvName": null, "desc": "Investor Presentation", "difference": "00:00:01", "dt": "11112026141640", "exchdisstime": "11-Nov-2026 14:16:41", "fileSize": "2.42 MB", "hasXbrl": true, "old_new": null,